  "A single command: curl the install.sh and you're done. Nothing to clone, no packages to pick by hand, nothing to fix afterwards.": "Um \u00fanico comando: descarrega o install.sh com o curl e est\u00e1 feito. Nada para clonar, nem pacotes para escolher \u00e0 m\u00e3o, nem nada para corrigir depois.",
  "It refuses to continue if this isn't Arch, if sudo isn't authenticated, or if there's no network. Before touching anything.": "Recusa-se a continuar se isto n\u00e3o for Arch, se o sudo n\u00e3o estiver autenticado ou se n\u00e3o houver rede. Antes de tocar em nada.",
